  "tutorial": [
    {
      "text": "You have 50 credits. Everything you build comes out of this, and killing anything pays a little back.",
      "anchor": {
        "kind": "hud",
        "id": "credits"
      },
      "done": {
        "kind": "tap"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Tap this tile to see what can stand here. It watches two runs of road at once.",
      "anchor": {
        "kind": "tile",
        "x": 5,
        "y": 4
      },
      "done": {
        "kind": "wheel",
        "x": 5,
        "y": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "A sentry costs 50 — everything you have. Take it.",
      "anchor": {
        "kind": "wheel",
        "turret": "basic"
      },
      "done": {
        "kind": "queued",
        "x": 5,
        "y": 4,
        "turret": "basic"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Now queue a second one down here. You cannot afford it, and that is the point: the queue buys it the moment the credits arrive.",
      "anchor": {
        "kind": "tile",
        "x": 3,
        "y": 8
      },
      "done": {
        "kind": "queued",
        "x": 3,
        "y": 8,
        "turret": "basic"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Press Play.",
      "anchor": {
        "kind": "button",
        "id": "play"
      },
      "done": {
        "kind": "running"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "That ring is the sentry's reach: it shoots what walks inside it, and nothing outside it. Where a gun stands matters more than how many you own.",
      "anchor": {
        "kind": "range",
        "x": 5,
        "y": 4
      },
      "done": {
        "kind": "tap"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Watch the first lot come through. Your second sentry pays for itself out of what they drop.",
      "done": {
        "kind": "kills",
        "count": 6
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The next lot comes thicker than two sentries can answer. Tap the first sentry and upgrade it — cheaper than a third gun, and it needs no new ground.",
      "anchor": {
        "kind": "tile",
        "x": 5,
        "y": 4
      },
      "done": {
        "kind": "upgraded",
        "x": 5,
        "y": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "The best tile left is under that tree. Tap the tree: every turret in reach will shoot it down, and its timber pays for the clearing.",
      "anchor": {
        "kind": "tile",
        "x": 2,
        "y": 8
      },
      "done": {
        "kind": "assigned",
        "x": 2,
        "y": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Your second sentry is chewing through it. Timber takes a moment, and it pays 20 credits when it goes.",
      "anchor": {
        "kind": "tile",
        "x": 2,
        "y": 8
      },
      "done": {
        "kind": "cleared",
        "x": 2,
        "y": 8
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "Ground cleared. Put your third sentry on it before the last wave arrives.",
      "anchor": {
        "kind": "tile",
        "x": 2,
        "y": 8
      },
      "done": {
        "kind": "queued",
        "x": 2,
        "y": 8,
        "turret": "basic"
      }
    },
    {
      "text": "That is the whole game: pick the ground, queue what stands on it, upgrade what is already working, and make room when there is none.",
      "done": {
        "kind": "tap"
      }
    }
  ]
